title: "sk-asr-bench"
abstract: "A reproducible benchmark of Slovak automatic speech recognition: open models (Whisper and Slovak fine-tunes, Parakeet/Canary) and commercial APIs scored on the same test sets with WER, CER, diacritics error rate and numeral/named-entity accuracy."
